  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Disaster Storms — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>At 3rd level, as an action for 2 cursed energy you can make a ranged cursed energy attack roll against a creature you can see within 60 ft. On a hit, you deal 3d6 lightning damage. </p>\n<p>If another creature is within 10 ft of the target, you can make another attack against them, dealing half as much damage on a hit. This damage increases to 4d6 at 6th level, 6d6 at 11th level, and 8d6 at 18th level.</p>",
